WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.190
In an increasingly globalized world, the ability to communicate across cultures has become essential for university students.
在一个日益全球化的世界里，跨文化交际能力对大学生来说已变得必不可少。

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:22.000
Whether they study abroad, work for international companies or simply make friends online, students will inevitably deal with people from different cultural backgrounds.
无论是出国留学、在跨国公司工作，还是仅仅在网上交朋友，学生都不可避免地要与来自不同文化背景的人打交道。

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:31.320
To develop this ability, students should first build a solid foundation in foreign languages, since language is the bridge between cultures.
为了培养这种能力，学生首先应该打下扎实的外语基础，因为语言是连接不同文化的桥梁。

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:34.340
However, language alone is not enough.
然而，光有语言是不够的。

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:47.950
Students also need to learn about the customs, values and ways of thinking of people in other countries, which they can do by reading widely, watching foreign films and taking courses in intercultural communication.
学生还需要了解其他国家人们的习俗、价值观和思维方式，他们可以通过广泛阅读、观看外国电影以及选修跨文化交际课程来做到这一点。

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:59.130
More importantly, they should seek real opportunities for interaction, such as joining international exchange programs or helping foreign students adapt to campus life.
更重要的是，他们应该寻找真正的互动机会，比如参加国际交流项目，或者帮助外国学生适应校园生活。

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:07.350
Throughout this process, students should keep an open mind and respect differences instead of judging others by their own standards.
在整个过程中，学生应当保持开放的心态，尊重差异，而不是用自己的标准去评判他人。

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:12.760
At the same time, they should take pride in sharing Chinese culture with the world.
同时，他们应当以向世界分享中国文化为荣。

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:19.210
By doing so, they can help people in China and other countries understand each other better.
这样一来，他们就能帮助中国和其他国家的人民更好地相互理解。
